  diseaseName: "\u0110\u1ED9c th\u1EF1c (Ng\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED9c th\u1EE9c \u0103n
    n\u1EB7ng)"
  diseaseLevel: 4
  diseaseGroup: 1
  description: "\u0110\u1ED9c t\xE0 t\u1EEB th\u1EE9c \u0103n ph\u1EA1m v\xE0o tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
    v\u1ECB, l\xE0m kh\xED c\u01A1 r\u1ED1i lo\u1EA1n v\xE0 ch\xEDnh kh\xED suy s\u1EE5p."
  patientDialogue: "Sau khi \u0103n c\u01A1m xong b\u1EE5ng t\xF4i \u0111au l\u1ED9n
    l\xEAn d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i, n\xF4n m\u1EEDa li\xEAn t\u1EE5c k\xE8m ti\xEAu ch\u1EA3y
    c\u1EA5p, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\xE3 m\u1ED3 h\xF4i l\u1EA1nh."
  symptoms:
  - symptomText: "B\u1EE5ng \u0111au qu\u1EB7n l\u1ED9n l\xEAn d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i sau
      \u0103n."
    showAtStep: 0
  - symptomText: "N\xF4n m\u1EEDa li\xEAn t\u1EE5c k\xE8m ti\xEAu ch\u1EA3y c\u1EA5p."
    showAtStep: 0
  - symptomText: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\xE3 m\u1ED3 h\xF4i l\u1EA1nh, m\u1EA1ch tr\u1EA7m
      y\u1EBFu."
